Z||000004||Sage||12-14-1999||03:54 PM||||DRH:  Howdy!  Welcome aboard.  I am kinda new here myself, but these guys seem to tolerate just about anybody, as long as you don't get too wierd or anything!  Everyone here seems to be willing to help whenever they can, and when they can't, they will try to point you to somebody that can.  You probably allready know all this stuff if you have been tuning in for a while, but that is what is so great about this site.  You can say whatever you feel and like the man said long ago," Sir, I may disagree with what you say, but I will defend to the death, your right to say it!"  Nuff said.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
