Z||000006||DRH||12-14-1999||06:30 PM||||dogtired, not TOO wierd other than my addiction to Fieros I seem to have aquired in the last couple of years  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>I have been a shade tree mechanic since I was 15 (literally back then). 25 years later I at least have an attached garage. <P>I have lived in Wisconsin for the last 7 years... I grew up in Alabama (still have family there)... I have also lived in TN, KY (inlaws there), GA and PA in between.<P>My daily driver is an 88 Formula 5spd I bought last April. So far I've fixed what seems to be the standard stuff: <BR>- cracked front exhaust manifold (cleaned up excess metal in the joints while I was at it) <BR>- replaced clutch master cylinder (leaking into floorboard) and slave cylinder (broke the "ear" off trying to loosen the bleeder)<P>Also have an 84 that I bought 2 years ago (it started my Fiero addiction). I gave it to my stepson when I got the Formula... we rebuilt the motor... he took it for it's first test drive last month and got t-boned in the passenger side by a girl who ran a stop sign  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  He's fine but the car is a total. I bought it back from the insurance company and plan to find a body in need of a motor next spring. <P>DJRice, Thanks for the tip. Here goes...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Carroll, It's David... tried to register that but someone had it... went with my initials.<P>David.<BR>||||reg||1
