Z||000009||Monkeyman||12-14-1999||10:20 PM||||Ditto on everything everybody else said.  This is absolutely, without a doubt the best and most informative forum of it's kind in existence. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  If they'll let me stay they'll tolerate anybody.<P>dogtired--I resemble that remark!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
